    {
      "target": "Strings/Movies",
      "key": "NaturalWonders_Scene2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The Fern Islands, a tropical paradise 80 miles off the southern coast. The islands formed due to volcanic activity in the region, and are still growing...",
      "translation": "Kapradinové ostrovy, tropický ráj 80 mil od jižního pobřeží. Ostrovy vznikly sopečnou činností v této oblasti a stále se rozrůstají...",
      "sourceSHA256": "8bb5123aa796d85e64ff86aafd1b8a8cc7f4f4f4066de04c7ba7fe3918af420a",
      "translationSHA256": "c9ce46ec1418fd408830a0d673070330ca9ad05033de57d1406bc0969369f453",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Strings/Movies",
      "key": "NaturalWonders_Scene3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The warm climate of the southern ocean allows for extreme biodiversity... in short, the island is teeming with life!",
      "translation": "Teplé podnebí jižního oceánu umožňuje mimořádnou biologickou rozmanitost... Zkrátka, ostrov překypuje životem!",
      "sourceSHA256": "b25562f51e4bc6593f6fac28021d004f0f7e7e1645abd13a4e10d74aa6da9330",
      "translationSHA256": "a368ce64762ab6b4d45384ac55946a5da527792b8a291e009a8549a9a8f944d4",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Strings/Movies",
      "key": "NaturalWonders_Scene4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Now we move north to the bustle of Zuzu City. It's a world of concrete and steel, illuminated by the glow of city light.",
      "translation": "Nyní se přesuneme na sever do ruchu města Zuzu. Je to svět betonu a oceli, ozářený městskými světly.",
      "sourceSHA256": "dfa9302de592ef2e9e16afb1c722bdd5892c66b8b2ed9f958f6bdc644c2957cc",
      "translationSHA256": "e4768fadd449697dc16a914aed2f8615a81d880a3eba171dd6c41c6136e9f04b",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Strings/Movies",
      "key": "NaturalWonders_Scene5",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The conditions may be harsh, but still, we find abundant life...",
      "translation": "Podmínky mohou být drsné, přesto zde nacházíme hojnost života...",
      "sourceSHA256": "7e062e1a079f2eece02321525958ff8f332d144ffc841d2fa985676d4e1e1003",
      "translationSHA256": "96fcc96d014253bac1214f04f0db12aee8bb8e4c8eb6719a223551094f599c08",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
